  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Coalition on Food Security - Stromme Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A coalition of local organisations already working on food security, jointly collaborating to implement a pilot on how strengthened local actors can shape and take charge of the food security agenda in South Sudan. The programme begins with a pilot phase which is envisioned to gradually grow into a full-fledged long-term programme</narrative>
  </description>
